data an_ended_lineage_has_no_operator_route_so_its_node_can_never_be_worked_again: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "an_ended_lineage_has_no_operator_route_so_its_node_can_never_be_worked_again" as NonEmptyStr,

  rung: RungRead { found_at: FoundOnRung { rung: Mitigatable }, standing: BelowCeiling { current: FoundOnRung { rung: MechanicallyPreventable }, ceiling: StructurallyGuaranteed, blocker: ClimbableButUnbuilt, trigger_capability: "an arm-to-writer census over every non-spawning ContinuationDecision arm is enrolled as a gate, so each arm names the record or route that releases it" } },

  receipts: [
    "an ended lineage has no operator route, so its node can never be worked again: a terminal fail-closed state (gunbc.roadmap.roadmap_attempt_continuation ContinuationEnded: starting over from base would discard committed work silently) was modelled with no transition out, and the reason text of the refusal said the operator decides while no route existed for the operator to decide. The state is correct to refuse; the defect is that the refusal named an authority nothing implemented, so the node was dead rather than held.",

    "SPECIMEN, found 2026-10-16 on the srv1 lab srv1-lab-codex-feedback-v0 at lab-dev 7acf7a3b916: shell-dag-floor-peak-calibration-rows (lineage ended at attempt bb29307f8f9bf3f9 on 2026-10-12, worker ended without hand-in) and host-conservation-shakedown-fixture-at-22-gib (ended at f288128c72d5db94) answered every dispatch with step lineage-ended, as did several other shell-dag nodes. Operator ruling 2026-10-16 (msg_7cda11c6): an operator retire-lineage record, then a fresh lineage; the declined alternatives were S3 resume alone (the node stays ended) and re-authoring the node under a new identity (a nickname for one node, DESIGN 3).",

    "THE REPAIR (LINEAGE-RETIRE-1): gunbc.roadmap.roadmap_lineage_retire LineageRetireRecord, a create-only record beside the ended attempt's state, read only by the Ended arm (continuation_decision_with_retirement); lineage_retire_admission admits only the lineage's current ended end; POST /dispatch/{node_id}/retire-lineage is one realization, behind human_write_admission under ServeActionRetireLineage, taking who and when from the authenticated session and the clock. The ended branch is kept; the record makes the discard explicit and attributable. CLAIMS: retire_claim_1 (RED on lab-dev), retire_claim_2/3/4 (controls), retire_claim_5 admission, record round-trip and the route's unauthenticated refusal.",

    "RECOGNITION RULE: a refusal whose reason text names an authority (the operator decides, a human resolves it) must have a constructor, route or record that authority can use; grep every Refused/Ended/Hold arm's reason for such a phrase and confirm a consumer that writes the decision. ATTAINABLE CEILING: a decision the model names as an operator's must be unwritable without its carrier -- structurally guaranteed would need a lens over decision arms whose reason cites an actor, and no such arm census exists, so the class sits at mechanically preventable only for this arm. NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER: an arm-to-writer census (every non-spawning ContinuationDecision arm names the record or route that releases it) enrolled as a gate; the sibling arms (Refused over an unreadable capture, Hold over a damaged segment) still name the operator without a route.",
    "RESULTS, PR 14189, BuildBuddy claim_batch --hermetic: PASS claims 1 (matching record spawns fresh citing it), 2 (other attempt refused as stale), 3 (active, held, complete, refused refused), 4 (no record stays Ended), 5 admission (only the ended end), 5 record shape (codec round trip read by the decision), commit-first-stands. Claim 1 is RED on lab-dev only by absence of the symbols (no baseline run on unmodified lab-dev). UNEXECUTED hermetically: the route's 403 (unauthenticated), 404 and 409 (non-ended attempt) legs and its 200 write leg, because the hermetic route has no mock_response for shell.Env.Get (the existing comment-route witness fails identically); they are verified only by the lab qualification on the deployed route.",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
